# Dreams, figures of speech and readings
#
# Dream content stays in mood dreamed. 'I am the thief' stays a metaphor. Scholars' readings stay 
# attributed.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m18_interpretation> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Dreams, figures of speech and readings" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crminf:I1_Argumentation

iy:Dream a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Event .
iy:Figure a owl:Class .
iy:Reading a owl:Class .

iy:readingBy a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:alternativeTo a owl:ObjectProperty .
